(DATA PRIVACY AND COMPUTATIONAL INTEGRITY ACT) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (1. Mandatory Local Processing Standard) Tj
T* (Any software system processing user files within this jurisdiction shall adhere to:) Tj
T* (1. Local storage of all document streams without external telemetry;) Tj
T* (2. Immediate in-memory cryptographic verification of file bounds;) Tj
T* (3. Prohibition of automatic network transmissions of document contents;) Tj
T* (4. Explicit user consent prior to external model pack installations.) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
